{
  "name": "vehicle-drive",
  "description": "Electric vehicle / industrial truck drive: Q1 feeds VFD U1 which generates a variable rotating field for the traction motor M1. The key switch SK, pedal interlock P1 (dead-man) and brake NC pole P2 gate the FWD/REV commands from the 3-position selector SD; the accelerator P1 also feeds U1's analog speed reference (R+/R-), so motor speed follows pedal travel. Pressing the brake opens the drive command, lights H2/H3 and mechanically decelerates M1; the e-stop SE1 kills the whole control chain. Try: key on, SD to I, then drag the throttle.",
